pan><span class="text-[17px] tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-[clamp(24px,2.4vw,40px)] md:font-light">Compactness</span></li></ol></div><div class="relative min-h-[240px] overflow-hidden rounded-[22px] border border-white/70 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)]" data-anchor="capabilities-panel" style="background:linear-gradient(rgba(29,42,49,0.045) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(29,42,49,0.045) 1px, transparent 1px), radial-gradient(90% 60% at 50% 30%, rgba(255,255,255,0.75) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 70%), linear-gradient(180deg, #e7eef1 0%, #dbe5e9 100%);background-size:28px 28px, 28px 28px, 100% 100%, 100% 100%"><span class="label-mono inline-flex items-center gap-[0.6em] whitespace-nowrap absolute left-4 top-4 text-ink/70"><span aria-hidden="true">[</span><span>Live view</span><span aria-hidden="true">]</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute right-4 top-4 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="size-1.5 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-glacier"></span><span class="label-mono text-ink/60">Rec</span></span><div class="absolute inset-x-4 bottom-4 grid"><span class="label-mono text-ink/70 [grid-area:1/1]" style="opacity:1">Pulse rate 240 kHz, 5 echoes</span><span class="label-mono text-ink/70 [grid-area:1/1]" style="opacity:0">Dual band 2.4 and 5.8 GHz</span><span class="label-mono text-ink/70 [grid-area:1/1]" style="opacity:0">Packed 42 x 18 x 11 cm</span></div></div><div class="grid content-start md:content-center"><div class="[grid-area:1/1]"><p class="text-[clamp(48px,7.5vw,136px)] font-light leading-[0.9] tracking-[-0.06em] text-ink" style="opacity:1">360°</p><p class="mt-3 max-w-[380px] text-[15px] leading-[1.5] tracking-[-0.01em] text-haze md:mt-6 md:text-[clamp(15px,1.15vw,18px)]" style="opacity:1">Everything around and below is measured in one sweep at 240,000 points a second: ground, steel and canopy alike.</p></div><div class="[grid-area:1/1]"><p class="text-[clamp(48px,7.5vw,136px)] font-light leading-[0.9] tracking-[-0.06em] text-ink" style="opacity:0">7 km</p><p class="mt-3 max-w-[380px] text-[15px] leading-[1.5] tracking-[-0.01em] text-haze md:mt-6 md:text-[clamp(15px,1.15vw,18px)]" style="opacity:0">A secure two-band link streams the live point cloud back to the operator and steps around interference on its own.</p></div><div class="[grid-area:1/1]"><p class="text-[clamp(48px,7.5vw,136px)] font-light leading-[0.9] tracking-[-0.06em] text-ink" style="opacity:0">42 cm</p><p class="mt-3 max-w-[380px] text-[15px] leading-[1.5] tracking-[-0.01em] text-haze md:mt-6 md:text-[clamp(15px,1.15vw,18px)]" style="opacity:0">Folds to 42 cm and is ready to fly in minutes, with no ground station and no tools.</p></div></div></div><span class="label-mono inline-flex items-center gap-[0.6em] whitespace-nowrap absolute bottom-4 left-4 text-haze md:bottom-6 md:left-10"><span aria-hidden="true">[</span><span>Tech</span><span aria-hidden="true">]</span></span><span class="label-mono inline-flex items-center gap-[0.6em] whitespace-nowrap absolute bottom-4 right-4 text-haze md:bottom-6 md:right-10"><span aria-hidden="true">[</span><span>Stats</span><span aria-hidden="true">]</span></span></div></section>
